<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>BPI		    15.50 /14.90  16.50 /15.50    17.50/16.00</p>
<p>Citibank	     15.00 /14.00  15.50 /14.25    16.00/15.00</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	16.00 /15.25  16.25 /15.50    16.50 /15.75</p>
<p>Metrobank	    15.25 /14.75  16.00 /15.00    16.75 /15.25</p>
<p>PNB		    15.75 /14.25  16.00 /14.75    17.00 /15.50</p>
<p>StanChart	    15.50 /15.00  16.25 /15.75    16.75 /15.75</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
